       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. WRITE-STUDENTS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT STUDENT-FILE ASSIGN TO "STUDENTS.DAT"
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD STUDENT-FILE.
       01 STUDENT-RECORD.
          05 STUDENT-ID PIC 9(4).
          05 STUDENT-NAME PIC X(15).
          05 STUDENT-MARKS PIC 999.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 RECORD-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN OUTPUT STUDENT-FILE.
           MOVE 1001 TO STUDENT-ID.
           MOVE "ANITHA RAJ" TO STUDENT-NAME.
           MOVE 88 TO STUDENT-MARKS.
           WRITE STUDENT-RECORD.
           ADD 1 TO RECORD-COUNT.
           MOVE 1002 TO STUDENT-ID.
           MOVE "BALAJI SUNDAR" TO STUDENT-NAME.
           MOVE 54 TO STUDENT-MARKS.
           WRITE STUDENT-RECORD.
           ADD 1 TO RECORD-COUNT.
           CLOSE STUDENT-FILE.
           DISPLAY "RECORDS WRITTEN: " RECORD-COUNT.
           STOP RUN.
